# Agency revamp

Before edits, read `docs/AGENTS.md` then `docs/DESIGN.md` and `docs/RULES.md`.

- Light-mode section backgrounds: white/near-white and yellow only
- Blue for CTAs, heading accents, section marks
- Multi-color service cards OK on white bands; not every section a different fill
- Dark mode: professional charcoal bands; accents on CTAs/icons
- No invented clients, logos, metrics, testimonials
- Floating contact: round icon → expand label on hover
- Preserve Lenis + Reveal; respect reduced-motion
- Keep marquee / visual showcase / case studies / FAQ layout; theme consistently
- Modular `components/home/<section>/`, `constants/`, `types/`
- Verify with `bun run typecheck` before finishing a batch
